>
>I haven't really checked there isn't any other factor, though.

There is one important thing I neglected in my previous post: At
present, you will only meet two covetous monsters *with AD_SAMU attacks*
in the entire game, and by the time you meet Rodney the other one is
definitely irrelevant and probably dead.

Hence, fake amulets are useless as padding against AD_SAMU attacks,
because they won't be stolen if you don't have the real thing and
Rodney won't steal them anyway.
